OL,8,Fsister was "really excited" to go on
OL,9,Fher first pilgrimage, but has now been
OL,10,Fout of contact
OL,12,FThe glacial collapse that is said to
OL,13,Fhave caused the flash floods happened
OL,14,Fon the Nepal side of the Himalayan
OL,15,Fmountains, Nepalese officials tell the
